      "summary": {
        "en": "The filing records a planned issue of up to 367,640,500 overseas-listed ordinary shares and full circulation for 693,909,187 existing domestic shares held by 51 shareholders. It confirms filing information, not investment value or completion of the listing.",
        "zh": "备案通知载明，芯德拟发行不超过 367,640,500 股境外上市普通股，并将 51 名股东持有的合计 693,909,187 股境内未上市股份申请全流通。该文件确认的是备案信息，不代表上市已经完成或对投资价值作出判断。"
