      "id": "ymtc-ti600s-20260818",
      "date": "2026-08-18",
      "title": {
        "en": "YMTC launches the ZHITAI Ti600s SSD",
        "zh": "长江存储发布致态 Ti600s 固态硬盘"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "The Ti600s uses YMTC Xtacking 4.0 QLC NAND and offers capacities from 512GB to 4096GB. YMTC states sequential read and write speeds of up to 7,400MB/s and 6,900MB/s, respectively.",
        "zh": "Ti600s 搭载长江存储晶栈® Xtacking® 4.0 QLC 闪存颗粒，提供 512GB 至 4096GB 容量；公司披露其顺序读写速度最高分别为 7400MB/s 和 6900MB/s。"
      },
