        "zh": "英韧科技展示 PCIe 6.0 SSD 与 CXL 接口 NAND"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "At FMS 2026, InnoGrit reported 10 million IOPS for 512-byte random reads in a PCIe 6.0 SSD demonstration using a Gen5 server and a PCIe 6.0 switch. It also demonstrated a 512GB CXL 3.1 NAND module. These are company-reported demonstration results.",
        "zh": "英韧科技在 FMS 2026 披露，使用 Gen5 服务器与 PCIe 6.0 交换机演示的 PCIe 6.0 SSD，在 512 字节随机读取中达到 1000 万 IOPS；同时展示了 512GB CXL 3.1 NAND 模组。以上属于公司披露的演示结果。"
